### Manually trigger data seeding for all tenants that don't have resources
POST http://localhost:8081/api/dev/seed/all
Content-Type: application/json

### Or get the tenant ID first and seed a specific tenant
### First, register an owner to see the tenant ID in the response, then use it below

### Seed a specific tenant (replace with actual UUID)
# POST http://localhost:8081/api/dev/seed/tenant/9d6686a3-72ed-4520-a0dd-1cdb1dfadbd9
# Content-Type: application/json

### Clear resources for a specific tenant (if you need to re-seed)
# DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/dev/seed/tenant/9d6686a3-72ed-4520-a0dd-1cdb1dfadbd9/resources
# Content-Type: application/json
